{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一名66歲的士司機，載著4名乘客駕駛期間昏迷。<br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上流傳的士車廂內的攝錄機，拍下驚險一刻。畫面左邊身穿灰色上衣的士司機，駕駛期間突然垂下頭，懷疑昏迷，身體左右搖擺。當時車上有四名乘客，大力拍打司機，並嘗試控制的士。的士滑行一段距離後才停下，歷時約50秒，乘客打開車門求救。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.DRIVER-1830.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026UK31bDVjzq1790766110.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.DRIVER-1830.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方表示事發在周一中午，的士當時沿呈祥道東行，駛至蝴蝶谷道交界時，司機懷疑暈倒，的士其後失控撞向石壆，司機昏迷送往明愛醫院治理，車上4名乘客均無受傷。據了解，司機有患病紀錄。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T11:18:44.851988+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}